font-12x22.png and font-17x32.png are glyph strips rasterized by make_font.py from DroidSansMono.ttf
(frameworks/base/data/fonts, Copyright The Android Open Source Project, Apache License 2.0: NOTICE).
Layout: ASCII 0x20..0x7e then Latin-1 0xa0..0xff side by side, regular on the top row and bold on the
bottom one. Regenerate with:

    for h in 22 32; do python3 make_font.py $ANDROID_BUILD_TOP/frameworks/base/data/fonts/DroidSansMono.ttf $h .; done
